    {
      "id": "s14",
      "type": "APPLE_STAGE",
      "transition": "push",
      "background": "zoneA",
      "narration": "Apple showed sustained performance rather than peak, and sustained is the honest measure, because hitting a number for one second is easy and holding it through a long export is not. Against the iPhone 17 Pro, the 18 Pro holds forty percent more. Against the 16 Pro, double. A second generation vapor chamber underneath is what pays for that.",
